<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech PSE suspends continuous session due to fault.</title>
<headline>Czech PSE suspends continuous session due to fault.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Prague Stock Exchange (PSE) said it had suspended Tuesday's continuous trading session due to technical problems.</p>
<p>A PSE official said the bourse would attempt to resume continuous trading before its official end at 1400 local time (1200 GMT).</p>
</text>
